/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The purpose of this seminar is to discuss the different types of sound therapy that have been studied as treatments for insomnia and sleep disorders. Specifically, we will be looking at studies that discuss how different sounds and frequencies decrease sleep latency. The most studied audios involve white or pink noise, but there is also speculation about the effects of binaural beats and audio at 432 Hertz.  )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
